{{en-adj|-}}

# On tiptoe, or as if on tiptoe; hence, raised as high as possible; lifted up; exalted; also, alert.
#* Shakespeare
#*: Night's candles are burnt out, and jocund day / Stands '''tiptoe''' on the misty mountain tops.
#* Byron
#*: above the '''tiptoe''' pinnacle of glory
# Noiseless; stealthy.
#* Cowper
#*: with '''tiptoe''' step

